  "lead": "Seasonally adjusted business applications were <b>578,926</b> in Jul 2026, +23.4% from a year earlier (SRC-613-01). Massachusetts filed <b>7,497</b>, rank 25 of 51 (derived, SRC-613-01). BLS Business Employment Dynamics put the Massachusetts private-sector establishment birth rate at <b>3.9%</b> in 2025 Q4 (8,540 establishments, SRC-613-02). Deaths are published through 2025 Q1, when the death rate was <b>2.6%</b> (5,722 establishments, SRC-613-02). In the last overlapping quarter, 2025 Q1, the birth rate was <b>2.9%</b> and the death rate was <b>2.6%</b> (SRC-613-02).",
